-10-20T06:13:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T06:13:48Z","body":"How does scrolling behave in Safari and other apps, @shakesoda and @Meorge when using the Logi app?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6284682703/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6294062270","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124196#issuecomment-6294062270","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124196","id":6294062270,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdyfEvg","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-20T15:06:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T15:06:34Z","body":"Unfortunately for testing purposes, I've since uninstalled the Logi Options+ app and started using [an open-source alternative called OpenLogi as per this comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110707#issuecomment-5774402384), so I can't easily record a video of the Logi Options+ behavior now.\n\nThat being said, overall I remember scrolling in Safari and other apps behaving \"normally\"; it never felt like scrolling there was too fast, and was in a natural direction. Godot (and specifically these versions of 4.8) were specifically the only apps where scrolling had issues.\n\nIf you feel it'd help to have a video of the behavior, I can reinstall Logi Options+ and try to replicate the behavior in Godot and compare it to the scrolling in Safari or other apps.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6294062270/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6300536682","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124196#issuecomment-6300536682","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124196","id":6300536682,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABd4qPag","user":{"login":"shakesoda","id":219510,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTUxMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219510?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shakesoda","html_url":"https://github.com/shakesoda","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shakesoda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shakesoda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shakesoda/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shakesoda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shakesoda/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shakesoda/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shakesoda/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shakesoda/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shakesoda/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-20T20:16:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T20:16:28Z","body":"it works fine in everything but godot, although the scroll acceleration behavior can be too sluggish sometimes in games (or at least parsec/steam remote play) and it'll take a lot of effort for them to register what should be one scroll wheel click.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6300536682/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]